{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0204_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bd4c7c351da799c29293d55849d4335907b31a2b10d7a066db4e20b0f10036f5", "ja": "（今日は、今度行われるライブの周辺視察に来た。\nでもこの商店街、なんか見覚えが……あ、あれは！）", "zh": "（今天来视察一下下次要举行的演唱会周边。\n不过，这条商店街总觉得似曾相识……啊，那是！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0204_1001_038chz", "source_sha256": "b6f185aa002ea3d336347fda94853f48f615ddf9c02bcbd92af1ffead2076d99", "ja": "ふんふんふ～ん……♪\n……え？　{$P$}！？", "zh": "哼哼哼～……♪\n……诶？{$P$}！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0204_1002_038chz", "source_sha256": "f9278c1a0adaab8531d925c11c6c886a0ba6a5b4fd295cc54924e21fbfa14c23", "ja": "どうしてこちらに！？\nハッ！？　まさか、わたくしの……！", "zh": "您怎么会在这里！？  \n啊！？难道说，是我的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0204_1003_p", "source_sha256": "91b5f97e2400950f94a2b2407d06040be8877da573fd4621a9c03e9fb41763af", "ja": "千鶴さん、奇遇ですね！　もしかして千鶴さんも、\n公演の前に、ライブ会場近辺の視察ですか？", "zh": "千鹤小姐，真巧啊！难道说，千鹤小姐你也是在公演前来视察演出会场附近吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0204_1004_038chz", "source_sha256": "d57809695844688634532d62fcbb2c269aacc64837c084adebca341fe9337ecc", "ja": "えっ……え、ええ！　そんなところですわ！\nそ、それでは、ごめんあそばせ！", "zh": "欸……嗯、嗯！差不多就是这样！那么，先失陪了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0204_1005_p", "source_sha256": "cdecf596e2ba801ec29201422619f20fa7c987c932b7155d02fdf71d59e6c992", "ja": "千鶴さん？\nあ、行っちゃった……急いでるのかな？", "zh": "千鹤小姐？\n啊，她已经走掉了……是赶时间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0204_1006_null", "source_sha256": "494a8a21b17fa48484e9adc722d510ca0bb45950f6a83ac4634d20abd6b6784f", "ja": "ライブ当日……。", "zh": "演出当天……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0204_1007_038chz", "source_sha256": "254e6392ec48aa6d88cc1b5cd384ceb0343eb1313e6a18c8ecfda717e8a723ba", "ja": "あの、{$P$}……。\nいま、少しよろしいかしら？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}……\n现在稍微打扰您一下可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0204_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c827c3a3ea4adb37a27ecb82c0b278c7ccf6c4b0fac5cfd2e92eb40c7b9e6f19", "ja": "ああ、千鶴さん。もうすぐ本番ですね。\nどうかしましたか？", "zh": "啊，千鹤。马上就要正式演出了。\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0204_1009_038chz", "source_sha256": "3e85dc737bceba8f9309a64ac95a3ca515a9c88cb5630a82bb3601586e1b8d86", "ja": "ええ。あの……先日、商店街でばったり\nお会いしたときのことなんですが……。", "zh": "是的。那个……关于前几天在商店街偶然与您见面的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0204_1010_038chz", "source_sha256": "9b5604a01bf4b17c6ba1b52680fa0192181d7abe33a6001143528828d7fadb21", "ja": "あのときは、ちゃんとご挨拶できずに、\n大変失礼いたしました。", "zh": "那时候没能好好向您打招呼，实在非常失礼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0204_1011_p", "source_sha256": "91e089c398a3a5bcb3b01ec5156f5218b5d6c3718b4bc653a0ee4e5721c1e63c", "ja": "いやいや！　全然気にしてないですよ。\n急いでいたみたいですけど、何かあったんですか？", "zh": "哪里哪里！我完全没放在心上。\n您好像很着急，是发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0204_1012_038chz", "source_sha256": "8046342a5524ab5d38afae477de5b23e5b9f92513902ec66cce4c977d9341738", "ja": "い、いえ……あの商店街は、わたくしの実家が……。\nゲフン！　お、お屋敷が近いので！", "zh": "不、不是……那条商店街，我的老家就在……  \n咳！因、因为宅邸就在附近！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0204_1013_038chz", "source_sha256": "a2f4f38bba2c17cba003fb2bb2bb9ee69af29678ac3e6527097e1be748d1f5b4", "ja": "{$P$}とお会いするなど\n思ってもみなくて、わたくし驚いてしまって……。", "zh": "完全没想到会遇到{$P$}，\n实在吓了我一跳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0204_1014_p", "source_sha256": "328666fe1fb7736cb8f3a754f860b3c33985a63b46549ef32f9faa0c4440732b", "ja": "あ、そうか！　そういえばそうでしたね！\nなんだかすごい偶然でしたね。", "zh": "啊，对了！这么一说，确实是这样呢！\n总觉得真是不可思议的巧合呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0204_1015_038chz", "source_sha256": "b7a42a5e3fd1ad89f0a27c0b4cdbd40946cdba84f4a1e2e07c4201bc1e55984a", "ja": "そうですわね、本当に……。\nあ！　それで、せっかくですから、ええと……。", "zh": "是啊，确实是这样……  \n啊！对了，难得有这个机会，那么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0204_1016_038chz", "source_sha256": "a5e6224ed239853b7ec283d2486c7f63c45c5d4760ef503a2c921d8f03daa37e", "ja": "今日は商店街の名物コロッケを、持ってきましたの。\nスタッフのみなさんで、召し上がってくださいまし！", "zh": "今天我带来了商店街的名产可乐饼。\n请工作人员们品尝吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0204_1017_p", "source_sha256": "52cd7f50b74f294f7f22ce8707a9235239ac1fb0e0691fd091c0d2120f2f40fa", "ja": "え、本当ですか！？　いやぁ、それはありがたい！\nさっそく、みんなに……。", "zh": "啊，真的吗！？那可真是太感谢了！我这就拿给大家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0204_1018_038chz", "source_sha256": "4fc7d7b283137a57cfb4d34329a446c6ab376ae857b556d2aacef416de36bf15", "ja": "あ、{$P$}、あの……。\nよろしければ、最初に食べていただけませんか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}，那个……  \n如果您不介意的话，可以请您先尝尝吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0204_1019_p", "source_sha256": "8fdec12cc7b7eec52cfb6058b90cdf4e19f926cfefb1a7a5de481d232f17e061", "ja": "え？　俺が最初に食べちゃっていいんですか？", "zh": "咦？我可以第一个吃吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0204_1020_038chz", "source_sha256": "cad7e7ab6fef039f1972e73a0b165c4383a7bdf089c541f0901982602c720d42", "ja": "はい！　たっぷりの愛情を込めて作っている\nコロッケですから。一番にご賞味いただきたくて。", "zh": "当然！这是我倾注了满满爱意制作的可乐饼，所以想请您第一个品尝。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0204_1021", "source_sha256": "419a9a223da5a818334f895ebd757b43708602df4ee2ff5be4e6749114983674", "ja": "いただきます！", "zh": "我开动了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0204_2000_p", "source_sha256": "546229f156401cffa49700ddd643bcf5d0a7118d1030e6d8485ab6c4414dae0d", "ja": "ありがとうございます、それじゃ、いただきますね！\n……うん、おいしいおいしい！", "zh": "谢谢你，那我就开动啦！\n……嗯，真好吃真好吃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0204_2001_038chz", "source_sha256": "48c4d40e0792d60ed62e90f21f037914a2be65a3f5ebb489553fc6f5eedb9225", "ja": "ふふっ♪　おかわりも、ありますのよ。\nたくさん召し上がってくださいましね……♪", "zh": "呵呵♪还有添饭哦。\n请多吃一些吧……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
